INSERT INTO `books` (`id`, `title`, `description`, `image`, `author`, `cover_image`) VALUES
(7, 'Global Lord: One more god-level talent every month', 'The Lord Game has come to reality, pulling everyone in the world into the Lord Game and becoming Lords one by one.\n\nEach person starts with a broken village, and can draw a talent every month to support the development of the territory.\n\nBut Fang Xiao discovered that he was different. He could draw two talents every month, and the extra one must be a god-level talent.\n\nSo, while other people were reluctantly promoting the village to a small city, he had already been promoted to a giant city.\n\nWhile others were still struggling to clean up enemies in the wilderness and distressed for a few resources, Fang Xiao had already begun to conquer cities and expand his territory.', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1760628338_68f10e72cd5a5.jpg'),
(10, 'Online Games: Infinite Devouring, Crazy Stacking Attributes at the Start', '[Sword Style + All People + Online Game + No Female Protagonist + Infinite Attribute Stacking + Infinite Skills + Infinite Equipment + Infinite Space]\n\nLin Fengtai traveled to another world and found that monsters had descended here and the world had become a game.\n\nThe school beauty girlfriend awakens an SSR-level talent skill and leaves proudly.\n\nBut she didn\'t know that Lin Feng\'s innate skills were even more terrifying.\n\n[Devour All Things (Super God Level)]\n\nEffect 1: Can devour the BUFF on the body, fix it and exist permanently.\n\nEffect 2: Can devour skill books and force learning regardless of requirements.\n\nEffect three: Can devour equipment, retain attributes and strengthen itself.\n\nLin Feng entered the demonized world and stacked attributes crazily.\n\n[Ding! You\'ve absorbed the buff, experience gained +100%, cumulative experience gained has reached 99999%.]\n\n[Ding! You have absorbed the flying sword technique, and the total number of flying swords has reached 999999!]\n\n[Ding! You swallowed the Lucky Ring, and your accumulated Luck value has reached 999999!]\n\n…\n\nWhen Lin Feng casually crushed a small monster, players a hundred meters away found that tens of thousands of equipment fell from the sky like rain.\n\nWhen the national war broke out, the alliance of hundreds of countries and their millions of troops planned to divide the Dragon Kingdom.\n\nLin Feng raised his hand, and billions of flying swords soared into the sky, covering the sky and the sun, as if the end of the world had come.\n\n\"Oh my god...\"\n\nEveryone was stunned.', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1760628710_68f10fe6940a4.jpg'),
(12, 'I can copy talents', 'Ye Tian: My friend, your ferocious beast, the armored rhinoceros, is pretty good. Can you let me touch it? The proud daughter of a certain heaven nodded in confusion. Ye Tian touched an armored rhinoceros and secretly copied the armored rhino\'s top defensive talent. Ye Tian: Friend, let’s make friends. Ye Tian stretched out his right hand, shook hands with the somewhat confused genius, and secretly copied the other person\'s advanced cultivation talent, revealing...', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1760711692_68f2540ce0c9b.jpg'),
(13, 'Honghuang: I, the demon clan, invite Nuwa to create humans', '[Prehistoric, system, demon clan, apotheosis, upgrade, passion]\n\nLuo Hao travels through the prehistoric world and binds the system!\n\nWhether it’s exercises, elixirs, or cultivation, it’s as if it’s free of charge!\n\nAs a demon, you must have the consciousness of a demon!\n\nAny teaching or teaching, they are all enemies in my eyes!\n\nMy purpose is to make the demon clan rise and prosper!\n\nBy accident, I became the strongest in the world!\n\nSince Nuwa is the mother of the earth, it is only natural for her to give birth to children and grandchildren for my demon clan, right?\n\nNuwa: Sir, I am willing.\n\nUm... This is not the right way to open it. Is Nuwa so happy?', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1760773352_68f344e8edac0.jpg'),
(14, 'No one understands rebirth better than me', '\"No one understands rebirth better than me!\"\nBecause others only read novels, but Guan Ren was actually reborn in a small county town in his hometown in 2011.\n“Make Rebirth Great Again!”\nWith this belief, Guan Renben thought that enjoying youth with his deskmate was the beginning of making up for regrets and creating happiness.\nHowever, when more and more women who could not be abandoned stood in front of Guan Ren one by one, he realized what it meant to have a long and arduous journey.\n(The introduction is weak, it\'s a daily urban campus story, mainly about love, and the female protagonist is not single.)\n\nNovel Keywords: No One Knows Rebirth Better Than Me (no pop-up window), No One Knows Rebirth Better Than Me (full text download), No One Knows Rebirth Better Than Me (latest chapter reading)', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1760774708_68f34a342b519.jpg'),
(16, ' Re: Evolution Online', 'Liam was a nobody, whether it was grades or sports or appearance or social life. Not because he didn\'t have a brain but because his luck was just that bad. However, everything changed when a mysterious game called \'Evolution Online was suddenly launched. The world he knew changed upside down!There was blood, death, and carnage everywhere. While everyone from small companies and big governments scrambled to get a foothold on this mysterious video game, some people\'s lives turned for the better and some for the worse.Liam, unfortunately, being the latter, still somehow ended up at the bottom of the barrel. His insignificant life was squished like an insect and his loved ones were destroyed right in front of him. In the end, he was already dead without ever having a single chance to fight back.But his story did not end there. Liam found himself returned back to the time before everything began!Watch as the young man who was once a nobody reaches for the pinnacle of strength and power wreaking havoc on the world that destroyed him once! This time everything will be different!', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1760953895_68f60627be937.jpg'),
(17, 'Invincible starts with predatory terms', 'What, are you a congenital sword body? Take it on you. Too dummies? Mine. The monk Yang Fan at the bottom of the fairy world accidentally activated the destiny plunder system, which can obtain physique spells by binding apprentices. Since then, others have closed his detainees, and others have been on the verge of stealing. Years later, Yang Fan has already stood on top of the fairy world, and his disciples are even more powerful.\n\nYang Fan: Isn\'t it difficult to be a fairy?\n\nShow more', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1760957008_68f612509c7e8.jpg'),
(18, 'Strengthen your offspring. All my descendants are big shots in the fairy world.', 'Qin Changqing traveled to the world of immortal cultivation and joined an immortal cultivation family.\n\nHe became a son-in-law and awakened a system to strengthen his offspring.\n\nIt consumes 10 years of life to strengthen the offspring into top-grade spiritual roots.\n\nIt consumes 100 years of life to strengthen the offspring into the best spiritual roots.\n\nConsume 1,000 years of life to strengthen the offspring into earth spirit roots. It consumes 10,000 years of life to strengthen the offspring into heavenly spiritual roots. ...\n\nConsume life, then..\n\nShow more', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1760958762_68f6192ad909e.jpg'),
(19, 'Simulating The Cultivation Of Immortals, I Reached The Nascent Soul Stage In Ten Days!', 'Lin Changqing is a low-level casual cultivator in the Black Water Market of the Wu Kingdom. He is thirty years old and still lingers on the second level of Qi training.\n\nJust when he had accepted that there was no hope for him to become an immortal in this life, he unexpectedly awakened to the Immortal Cultivation Simulator.\n\n[You are unwilling to stay at the second level of Qi Refining for life, so you decide to participate in a secret realm adventure in three days. It is said that it was left behind by a foundation-building cultivator.]\n\n[You entered the secret realm, and although you were seriously injured by the monster, you were lucky enough to get a few bottles of Qi-gathering pills. After returning, you relied on the pills to successfully break through the third level of Qi training.]\n\n[You died two and a half years later. Although you made a breakthrough, the serious injury was not healed. You eventually died and the simulation failed.]\n\n[Settlement Simulation Reward: Qi Training Level 3]\n\n[Note: the host\'s cultivation in the simulation will be reflected in reality.]\n\n\"Is this the third level of Qi training?\"\n\nAs the simulation ended, Lin Changqing suddenly fell into deep thought as he felt his own cultivation level improve.\n\nThis simulation seemed to take five seconds in total?\n\nHow long does it take to reach the Nascent Soul stage?\n\n……\n\nTen days later, a female demon with golden elixir level attacked Heishui Market. Just when everyone was in panic, Lin Changqing appeared out of nowhere. He stood tall and slapped out with one palm.\n\n\"You look good, come and warm my bed!\"\n\n\"What!? Yuanying old monster!\" Looking at the giant hand that covered the sky and the sun, the Jindan female demon screamed in fear!\n\nShow more\n', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1760959039_68f61a3fc6945.png'),
(21, 'Shuttle between two worlds to become an invincible god', '(Reselling in Two Worlds + Super Rich + Invincible in the City)\nSeeing the cat girl at the beginning, Su Jie discovered that he could travel between the two worlds.\nSo they took the cigarettes and ironware with them and brought back the ginseng and elixirs.\nSu Jie traveled between the two worlds, not only making himself the richest man in the world, but also becoming the number one immortal cultivator in the city.\nLook at me, I am invincible in the city and the rich man from another world is king!\n\nNovel Keywords: Shuttle Between Two Worlds to Become an Invincible Godly Man (no pop-up ads), Shuttle Between Two Worlds to Become an Invincible Godly Man (full text download), Shuttle Between Two Worlds to Become an Invincible Godly Man (latest chapter reading)', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761235327_68fa517f67e8d.jpg'),
(22, 'Outrageous! The game has just been invaded, and you have become the Demon Lord?', 'The cross-time and space game \"Xiu Xian World\" has emerged, the invasion and fusion of reality is imminent, and all mankind is taking action.\nAll the major immortal cultivation sects are overcrowded, and millions of players have spent all their money just to fight for the qualification to enter.\nYe Feng, however, took a different approach. He found a sect of magic, chose to become its apprentice, spent millions of dollars, and became a demon son of the sect, with a status comparable to that of the Holy Son.\nNo one cares about the Demon Sect because the whole world is suppressing it and there is no environment for the Demon practitioners to practice.\nYe Feng was able to travel through the apocalypse and own a zombie world, with no shortage of resources for cultivation!\nIs it difficult to cultivate demonic cultivation? Living a life of mediocrity? I rely on the apocalypse, refine doomsday zombies, gather infinite death energy, and become the Supreme Demon Lord!\nAre magic weapons hard to come by? I gathered billions of zombies and refined the supreme magic weapon, the \'Billion-Layered Bone Banner\', to suppress all immortal weapons!\nWhile other players were still struggling to cultivate, Ye Feng had already risen with the help of the Zombie Planet and was far ahead of all players.\nWhen the game merged with reality, when the immortal cultivation players were proud of their own cultivation, they found that Ye Feng had already become the Supreme Demon Lord!\nWhen hundreds of millions of players united to attack Ye Feng, they were all dumbfounded!\nHow can you, a demon cultivator, be so full of merits, protected by the heavens, and invulnerable to all disasters?\n\nNovel keywords: Outrageous! The game just invaded, you become the devil? No pop-up window, Outrageous! The game just invaded, you become the devil? txt full set download, Outrageous! The game just invaded, you become the devil? Latest chapter reading', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761237900_68fa5b8c386ee.jpg'),
(23, 'Douluo: My system is not convinced again', 'Now in this Myriad Realms, how can we play without a system!\nStart the awakening system and get the weirdest disobedience system!\n\"The system detects that the host is envious of Tang San\'s twin martial souls. The system expresses dissatisfaction and helps the host awaken the triple martial souls!\"\n……\n\"The system detects that the host is envious of Tang San who is about to obtain the eight spider spears with the external spirit bone. The system expresses dissatisfaction and presents the host with the ancient wings of the dragon and phoenix with the external spirit bone!\"\n……\n\"The system detected that the host was being brutalized by Zao Wou-ki, the system expressed dissatisfaction, and has given away a Contra experience card.\"\n……\nApart from envy and dissatisfaction, is there anything else to play?\nOf course you can play!\n\"The system detected that the host prevented Tang San from absorbing the spirit ring of the Man-faced Demon Spider, subverting the original story line and rewarding [-] attribute points.\"\n\nNovel keywords: Douluo\'s My System Is Not Convinced Again No pop-up window, Douluo\'s My System Is Again Unconvinced txt Complete Works Download, Douluo\'s My System Is Not Convinced AgainLatest chapter reading', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761311528_68fb7b2859411.jpg'),
(24, 'Douluo: Peerless Black Tortoise Moon God', '\"I\'ve said from the beginning that I didn\'t capture Shrek to claim justice as my own. I simply wanted to avenge the murder of my mother by Sea God Pavilion Master Xuanzi and the humiliation of my mother by Shrek Dean Yan Shaozhe. While I did make some small contributions to the people of the mainland during this process, they were incidental. Please don\'t misunderstand me. Seek truth from facts, recognize reality, and don\'t place excessive moral constraints on me. That\'s not good.\"\nXu Tianxi, the eternal emperor of the Sun-Moon Empire who unified the continent, said this during an interview with Miss Meng Hongchen, chief reporter of Douluo Daily, during the Heavenly Sacrifice Ceremony held by Shrek.\nThe next day.\n\"I\'ve said from the beginning that I conquered Shrek to uphold the banner of justice, to avenge the murder of my mother by Sea God Pavilion Master Xuanzi and the insult to my mother by Shrek Dean Yan Shaozhe, and to make many contributions to the people of the mainland. I ask the general public to seek truth from facts, recognize reality, and have high moral constraints on me personally. This is very good.\"\n——Mr. Xiao Hongchen, the chief editor of Douluo Daily, is personally writing this article and reporting to you sincerely.\n\nNovel Keywords: Douluo Dalu: The Peerless Black Tortoise Moon God (no pop-up ads), Douluo Dalu: The Peerless Black Tortoise Moon God (full text download), Douluo Dalu: The Peerless Black Tortoise Moon God (latest chapter reading)', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761311561_68fb7b493c5a1.jpg'),
(25, ' My wife is in my arms', '\"Would you please go to work!?\"\n\"We agreed that I would get paid on time every month and you would take care of the money-making.\"\nAs a reborn person.\nBrother Ayou said this shamelessly.\n\nNovel keywords: My Wife in My Arms (no pop-up ads), My Wife in My Arms (full text download), My Wife in My Arms (latest chapter reading)', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761311596_68fb7b6c2f13a.jpg'),
(26, ' I am a master in India', '\"Baba~\"\n\"What did you call me?!\"\n\"Baba, does the master like to listen to the master?\" Nia looked innocent.\n\"No! You should just call me dad~\" Ron\'s smile gradually became perverted.\n\nNovel keywords: I am a master in India without pop-up window, I am a master in India txt full download, I am a master in India latest chapter reading', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761311628_68fb7b8c189f8.jpg'),
(27, 'DC: I, Kamen Rider, am not a sorcerer', '\"The possibilities of alchemy are endless. Don\'t define alchemy arbitrarily, asshole!\"\n\"What do you mean by predetermined fate? I don\'t understand!\"\n\"I want to be a hero, so I act accordingly. Other people\'s comments and words have nothing to do with me!\"\n\"Amanda Waller! You\'re trampling on freedom at will. What kind of justice is this?\"\n[Fan parallel universe, infinite marginal system, the framework refers to N52, DCAMU, CW, Shao Zheng and Wayne Family Adventure, etc.]\n\nNovel Keywords: DC: I, Kamen Rider is not a Warlock (no pop-up ads), DC: I, Kamen Rider is not a Warlock (full text download), DC: I, Kamen Rider is not a Warlock (latest chapter reading)', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761311664_68fb7bb0df6c7.jpg'),
(28, ' Naruto\'s civilian cannon fodder starts with the three-body technique', 'After his soul traveled to the ninja world, Umino Sasuke became an ordinary cannon fodder Chunin. He was born into a common family, had mediocre chakra, and only knew the three-body technique.\nFaced with the monopoly of ninjutsu, without the bloodline of the Ninja Clan and without the golden finger, in order to survive better in the Second Ninja World War, he could only use scientific thinking to deconstruct the Three Body Technique.\nWhile the Konoha high-level officials were busy using the Will of Fire to harvest cannon fodder.\nHe analyzed the beast-like breathing method from the transformation technique.\nWhen the genius of the ninja clan uses his bloodline limit to kill everyone.\nHe analyzed the human puppet bloodline clone from the clone technique.\nWhen the Six Paths Staff collided with the Flying Thunder God.\nHe analyzed the quantum teleportation from the substitution technique, which was almost as powerful as the power of heaven.\n……\nThis book is also known as: \"The Survival Counterattack of the Civilian Ninja\", \"The Beast-like Transformation Bat Perception 500 Miles Away\", \"My Five Shadow Puppet Clones\", \"The Thunder God Can\'t Fly, Only Knows Quantum Teleportation\"\n\nNovel Keywords: Naruto: Civilian Cannon Fodder Starting from the Three Body Technique (no pop-up ads), Naruto: Civilian Cannon Fodder Starting from the Three Body Technique (txt download), Naruto: Civilian Cannon Fodder Starting from the Three Body Technique (latest chapter reading)', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761311696_68fb7bd0115ad.jpg'),
(29, 'Rebirth of Chinese Entertainment, starting with the strategy of 95 flowers to counterattack', 'Reporter: \"Excuse me, who is the most talented person in the entertainment industry?\"\nThe 95 flowers all replied in unison: \"Gu Yang!\"\nReporter: \"Why?\"\nSister Meng: \"Because he wrote a song for me, which made me a peerless singer!\"\nZhou Ye: \"Because he helped me regain my confidence!\"\nXiao Tong: \"Because he made me not make the official announcement, we broke up!\"\nOda: \"Because he made me and Yitong together!\"\nDudu: \"Because he is taking me to the postgraduate entrance examination!\"\nGu Yang: \"Don\'t talk nonsense, it was the system that made me do it!\"\nReborn in 2016, Gu Yang was stunned when he saw the introduction of the system!\n\nNovel Keywords: Reborn in Huayu, Starting from the Strategy of 95 Flowers to Counterattack (no pop-up window), Reborn in Huayu, Starting from the Strategy of 95 Flowers to Counterattack (txt download), Reborn in Huayu, Starting from the Strategy of 95 Flowers to Counterattack (latest chapter reading)', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761311729_68fb7bf1e6851.jpg'),
(30, ' Versatile Mage: Get the Desert Emperor clone at the start', 'Qin Xiaonan accidentally traveled to the world of Versatile Mage and gained a powerful clone, the Desert Emperor in the League of Legends.\nThen, in the Demon Empire of the Sahara Desert, the sun disc descended and thousands of powerful desert soldiers appeared, helping the Tsar to defeat the original Lord of the Sahara and become the new King of the Roof of the World.\nHowever, who would have thought that one of the most powerful emperors in the world would be the incarnation of a magic apprentice who had just awakened his magic?\nA child of an aristocratic family, backed by a powerful clan.\nQin Xiaonan has a clone, the Queen of the Sands, who gives him the support of a powerful demon empire and an inexhaustible supply of essence, making him the most heroic wizard.\nAt the same time, his main body breaks through, and he will gain another clone every time he adds a new system.\nBreak through the intermediate level, awaken healing magic, obtain the clone Soraka, the Son of the Stars, walk the world and heal all living beings.\nBreaking through the high level, awakening the space magic, obtaining the clone of the Void Queen Belvis, appearing in the Alps, the \"backbone of Europe\", and creating a new demon empire.\nBreaking through the super level,...\n\nNovel Keywords: Versatile Mage: The Desert Emperor\'s Clone is Obtained at the Beginning (no pop-up ads), Versatile Mage: The Desert Emperor\'s Clone is Obtained (txt download), Versatile Mage: The Desert Emperor\'s Clone is Obtained (latest chapter reading)', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761311756_68fb7c0c76e07.jpg'),
(31, 'Douluo: Martial Soul Nine-Tailed Fox, I am the White Fox Emperor', 'He traveled through time and space and became Hu Liena\'s twin brother Hu Bai. He was born with full soul power, his martial soul returned to his ancestral state, and he mutated into a nine-tailed white fox. He was naturally friendly to natural elements and combined charm, luck, and wisdom into one.\nHowever, Bibi Dong wanted to go for the ultimate spiritual charm at the beginning because of her preconceived notions. It was ridiculous!\nThe nine-tailed fox was a mythical beast in ancient times, and charm was only one of its abilities. Male nine-tailed foxes placed more emphasis on killing ability!\nHu Bai resolutely chose a different path from Hu Liena, completely controlling the power of nature for his own use, and eventually became the Nine-tailed Fox Emperor!\n......\nHu Liena: \"Why are all their spirits Nine-Tailed Fox, but Brother Bai is so powerful? He obviously doesn\'t specialize in Charm, but he has the Charm trait. So handsome!\"\nQian Renxue: \"What? There is someone in this world with better talent than me? This person could become my fiancé?\"\nShui Bing\'er: \"Thank you, Brother Hu Bai, for helping me control the power of the Ice Phoenix.\"\nTang San: \"Why are my Blue Silver Grass and Clear Sky Hammer out of control?\"\nMany years later, the name of the Fox Emperor resounded throughout the world. This time, he was no longer famous for his charm, but appeared before the world in a mysterious and powerful posture!\n\nNovel Keywords: Douluo Dalu: Martial Soul Nine-Tailed Fox, I Am the White Fox Emperor (no pop-up ads), Douluo Dalu: Martial Soul Nine-Tailed Fox, I Am the White Fox Emperor (txt download), Douluo Dalu: Martial Soul Nine-Tailed Fox, I Am the White Fox Emperor (latest chapter reading)', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761312521_68fb7f092954a.jpg'),
(32, 'Douluo: The Elves Have Arrived, I Am the God of Creation', 'Yunxiao was accidentally brought to Douluo Continent by the system, but before he woke up, his system started fighting with Douluo God Realm.\n\nThe final result was that the system self-destructed, destroying the Douluo God Realm. Fortunately, before the system self-destructed, it left behind a novice gift pack and a half-plane...\n\n\n........................\n\nYunxiao: Titled Douluo, Immortal Species, Elf Clan???\n\nVery good, you are not a human being from the beginning.\n\nEyes of ice and fire?\n\nThis was clearly left behind by my elf clan in Douluo Continent!\n\nWhen Yunxiao became the God of Creation.\n\nA certain God King\'s eyes were red, he was panting like an ox, and he roared to the sky.\n\n\"The Divine Beast Clan cannot become a god. You have already chosen the path to death.\"\n\nYun Xiao spread his hands upon hearing this: \"Soul beasts cannot become gods, so what does this have to do with my elf clan?\"\n\nNovel Keywords: Douluo Dalu: The Elves Descend, I Am the God of Creation (no pop-up ads), Douluo Dalu: The Elves Descend, I Am the God of Creation (txt download), Douluo Dalu: The Elves Descend, I Am the God of Creation (latest chapter reading)', NULL, '', 'book_covers/book_1761312549_68fb7f25a2d32.jpg');
